- `.cuda()` calls in [hf_tp_generate.py](file:///c:/Users/chris/Downloads/hrm_flashrenderer/engine/hf_tp_generate.py): werden durch [to(device)](file:///c:/Users/chris/Downloads/hrm_flashrenderer/hrm_flash/prompt_builder.py#62-66) ersetzt

